Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
`$KernelCount` reports how many parallel kernels are currently available. This number controls the maximum amount of work that can run at the same instant.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
`$KernelCount` reports how many parallel kernels are currently available. This number controls the maximum amount of work that can run at the same instant.

