## 8. ParallelSubmitFunctionAsync
An an additional helper function `ParallelSubmitFunctionAsync` allows an inner expression __make callback manually__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## 8. ParallelSubmitFunctionAsync
An an additional helper function `ParallelSubmitFunctionAsync` allows an inner expression __make callback manually__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
promise = ParallelSubmitFunctionAsync[
		Function[{url, cbk}, 
			With[{data = URLRead["http://google.com"]},
				cbk[data];
			];
		],
		
		"http://google.com"
];

promise // WaitAll // Shallow 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
